WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:07.330
Vivian: When I was actually applying to Hillsdale,
the WHIP program was a major factor in wanting

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:11.590
to come to Hillsdale in the first place. I'm
an editorial intern, so every day I post

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:16.720
our website's videos. I write posts about foreign
policy, things that are going on in the Hill.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:20.770
Especially from the journalism prospective
it's a unique city to be in because we have

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:25.810
congress and we have the White House, so it's
a really unique opportunity to actually go

00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:30.380
to events where news in happening.
I think one of the best parts about being

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:34.230
on WHIP during the semester as opposed to being
the summer is that you get to take classes

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:39.800
with Hillsdale professors. You learn so much.
I'd definitely say that the time spent in

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:43.620
Washington, DC with the WHIP program is definitely
worth it. You still do have a community of

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:47.710
Hillsdale students in the area. It's really
easy to keep up with your friends with Skype

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:53.130
and Facebook and Twitter, so I would definitely
say that the investment is definitely worth it.

